stateDiagram-v2
  state "S-D03-021-01 미낭독" as unread
  state "S-D03-021-02 낭독중" as reading
  state "S-D03-021-03 선택가능" as selectable
  state "S-D03-021-04 재시도가능" as retry
  state "S-D03-021-05 만료" as expired
  [*] --> unread
  unread --> reading: current prompt attempt
  reading --> selectable: exact attempt DONE and current owner
  reading --> retry: failed terminal opens answer window
  selectable --> reading: repeat or page change revokes authority
  retry --> reading: explicit retry whole page
  selectable --> expired: answer age reaches 30s or owner changes
  retry --> expired: 30s or owner changes
  reading --> expired: cancel or owner changes
  expired --> unread: repeat current visible list creates new lease
